<span id="S0.F2.pic1.p3.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:20.29em;">
<span id="S0.F2.pic1.p3.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S0.F2.pic1.p3.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">Riley v. California, <span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="S0.F2.pic1.p3.pic1.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="9.61" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:-2.88px" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 98 9.61" width="98"><g transform="translate(0,9.61) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0) translate(49,0) translate(0,5.84)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:0.5em;--ltx-fo-height:0em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:7.35pt;" height="0" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)" width="5.09"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"></span></span></foreignObject><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" stroke="#000000"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:0.5em;--ltx-fo-height:0em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:7.35pt;" height="0" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)" width="5.09"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"></span></span></foreignObject><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:0.5em;--ltx-fo-height:0em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:7.35pt;" height="0" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)" width="5.09"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"></span></span></foreignObject><g stroke-width="0.4pt"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:0.5em;--ltx-fo-height:0em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:7.35pt;" height="0" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)" width="5.09"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"></span></span></foreignObject><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 -48.31 -2.96)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:9.5em;--ltx-fo-height:0.66em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.08em;font-size:7.35pt;" height="7.53" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 6.73)" width="96.62"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">573 U.S. 373 (2014)</span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#00B400;--ltx-fill-color:#00B400;--ltx-fg-color:#00B400;" color="#00B400" fill="#00B400" stroke="#00B400" stroke-width="1.0pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M -48.31 -5.15 L 48.31 -5.15"></path></g><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:0.5em;--ltx-fo-height:0em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:7.35pt;" height="0" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)" width="5.09"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"></span></span></foreignObject></g></svg></span>, was a landmark United States Supreme Court case that addressed the issue of warrantless searches of mobile devices. Here’s the factual background:
