<span id="A2.F8.pic1.3.2" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A2.F8.pic1.3.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:50%;">Valproate is explicitly contraindicated as first-line treatment and carbamazepine is not recommended first-line, while lithium requires careful monitoring and is not automatic first-line.</span></span>
