<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 8: </span>An annotated example of hallucination detection in a response to a HealthBench prompt.
The <span id="A2.F8.5" class="ltx_text ltx_ulem_uline">underlines</span> indicate entity spans labeled by our annotation pipeline: <span id="A2.F8.6" class="ltx_text ltx_ulem_uline" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">green</span> denotes entities labeled as supported, while <span id="A2.F8.7" class="ltx_text ltx_ulem_uline" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">red</span> denotes entities labeled as hallucinated. Hallucination detection probe scores for each token are shown as <span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.F8.pic3" class="ltx_picture" height="13.68" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:-3.38px" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 102.16 13.68" width="102.16"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,13.68) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0) translate(51.08,0) translate(0,6.84)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFBF;" fill="#FFFFBF"><path style="stroke:none" d="M -51.08 -6.84 h 102.16 v 13.68 h -102.16 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 -50.39 -3.46)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:7.37em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="101.93"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A2.F8.pic3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">yellow highlights</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>, with the intensity reflecting the score’s magnitude (scores below 0.25 are not shown).</figcaption>
</figure>
