</span></span> <span id="A7.T4.2.3.1.1.3" class="ltx_text"></span></span></td>
<td id="A7.T4.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><span id="A7.T4.2.3.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Semantic entropy</span></td>
<td id="A7.T4.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><span id="A7.T4.2.3.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">0.7082</span></td>
<td id="A7.T4.2.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><span id="A7.T4.2.3.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">0.2368</span></td>
<td id="A7.T4.2.3.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><span id="A7.T4.2.3.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">0.6757</span></td>
<td id="A7.T4.2.3.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><span id="A7.T4.2.3.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">0.2885</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T4.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T4.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><span id="A7.T4.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Entropy</span></td>
<td id="A7.T4.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><span id="A7.T4.2.4.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">0.7300</span></td>
<td id="A7.T4.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><span id="A7.T4.2.4.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">0.2900</span></td>
<td id="A7.T4.2.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><span id="A7.T4.2.4.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">0.7389</span></td>
<td id="A7.T4.2.4.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><span id="A7.T4.2.4.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">0.3701</span></td></tr>
