</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.23 74.71)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:13.93em;--ltx-fo-height:0.63em;--ltx-fo-depth:4.8em;font-size:10pt;" height="75.07" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.65)" width="192.75"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A9.F15.pic1.p3.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:13.93em;">
<span id="A9.F15.pic1.p3.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.F15.pic1.p3.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">The anagram “O UGLY NINE” can be rearranged to spell <span id="A9.F15.pic1.p3.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFC8C8;">“Lynyrd Skynyrd”</span>, which is a famous American rock band.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</span>
<span id="A9.F15.pic1.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_minipage ltx_noindent ltx_align_top" style="width:156.9pt;"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A9.F15.pic1.p4.pic1" class="ltx_picture" color="#000000" height="46.04" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 217.14 46.04" width="217.14"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,46.04) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#B3B3B3;" fill="#B3B3B3" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 4.35 L 0 41.69 C 0 44.09 1.95 46.04 4.35 46.04 L 212.78 46.04 C 215.19 46.04 217.14 44.09 217.14 41.69 L 217.14 4.35 C 217.14 1.95 215.19 0 212.78 0 L 4.35 0 C 1.95 0 0 1.95 0 4.35 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FAFFFA;" fill="#FAFFFA" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.42 4.35 L 0.42 27.23 L 216.72 27.23 L 216.72 4.35 C 216.72 2.18 214.96 0.42 212.78 0.42 L 4.35 0.42 C 2.18 0.42 0.42 2.18 0.42 4.35 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.23 33.04)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:14.07em;--ltx-fo-height:0.63em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.11em;font-size:10pt;" height="10.1" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.65)" width="194.69"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A9.F15.pic1.p4.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:14.07em;">
