<section id="A11" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix K </span>Compute statement</h2>

<div id="A11.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A11.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Training a LoRA-based probe for Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct on the full annotated dataset (as specified in Section <a href="#S4.SS1" title="4.1 Experimental setup ‣ 4 Long-form hallucination detection ‣ Real-Time Detection of Hallucinated Entitiesin Long-Form Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.1</span></a>) with a batch size of 8 takes less than 2 hours on an H100 GPU.</p>
</div>
</section>
